  <description lang="en-GB" default="true">One of the renowned blades that can slash mononokes into two. Bestowed with the power of fire. (Drawn) \nAttacking Strength: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ja-JP" default="false">物の怪を切り裂く天下の名刀の一つ。火属性を帯びている。（抜刀状態）\n攻撃力 ：★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-US" default="false">One of the renowned blades that can slash mononokes into two. Bestowed with the power of fire. (Drawn) \nAttacking Strength: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-SG" default="false">One of the renowned blades that can slash mononokes into two. Bestowed with the power of fire. (Drawn) \nAttacking Strength: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="fr-FR" default="false">L'une des lames légendaires capables de trancher les mononokés en deux. Imprégnée du pouvoir du feu. (Dégainée)\nPuissance d’attaque : ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="es-ES" default="false">Una de las espadas legendarias que puede partir a los mononokes en dos. Dotada del poder del fuego. (Desenvainada)\nFuerza de ataque: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="it-IT" default="false">Una delle lame leggendarie in grado di tagliare i mononoke a metà. Infusa con il potere del fuoco. (Sguainata)\nPotenza d'attacco: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="de-DE" default="false">Eine der legendären Klingen, die Mononokes in zwei Hälften schneiden kann. Mit der Kraft des Feuers versehen. (Gezogen)\nAngriffsstärke: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-HK" default="false">傳說中的名刀之一，能將物之怪一刀兩斷。蘊含火焰之力。（拔刀）\n攻擊力：★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-TW" default="false">傳說中的名刀之一，能將物之怪一刀兩斷。蘊含火焰之力。（拔刀）\n攻擊力：★★★-[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ko-KR" default="false">모노노케를 두 동강 낼 수 있는 전설적인 명검 중 하나. 불의 힘이 깃들어 있다. (발도)\n공격력: ★★★-[#Legal]</description>
